              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "das Guthaben — \"the credit (balance)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Auf meinem Handy habe ich noch zehn Euro Guthaben. I still have ten euros of credit on my mobile."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Guthaben. Literally what you have to your good."
            }
          ]
        },
